# Release signing material — NEVER COMMIT (P28)
# The keystore lives outside Git: an offline owner backup plus the four
# GitHub Secrets (ANDROID_KEYSTORE_BASE64 / _PASSWORD / ALIAS / KEY_PASSWORD).
# *.jks / *.keystore / android/key.properties are already listed above; these
# extra patterns cover the modern PKCS12 extension and the runner-local dir.
*.p12
*.pem
.runtime/

